One-time production operational reset approved on 2026-09-28/29.

Scope:
- preserve members/athletes, family and sports training history;
- preserve configuration/catalogues including monthly fees and member monthly-fee assignment;
- clear operational finance/bank/invoicing/receipts;
- clear fictitious store orders, logistics requests/purchases/loans and stock ledger;
- reset product/variant stock snapshots to zero;
- clear fictitious competitions, races, registrations and results.

Execution is performed once by CI after a dedicated PostgreSQL backup.
